Description: A developer-facing type system for R whose runtime is the
    'rtemis-r8' 'Rust' crate, shared with other host languages. Types are
    structs, enums, and traits, declared in R or in 'Rust'; values are
    immutable and validated once per value. This version reports the version
    of the compiled 'rtemis-r8' crate; declarations, validation, and JSON
    encoding are under development.
URL: https://www.rtemis.org, https://github.com/rtemis-org/r8
